Udu
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
RAEBEJ 1 FACE_ALL
RAEBEJ 6 FACE_LAST
RAEBEJ 10 FACE_LAST
RAEBEJ 6 FACE_LAST

NOB 3 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE NOB RAEBEJ
DEST Rank 1
MOVE_STACK NOB RAEBEJ
OR
    SRC Rank 1
    AND
        SRCSTACK Rank add_13
        DEST Suit {SPADES, DIAMONDS}
MOVE_STACK RAEBEJ NOB
AND
    DESTSRC Suit match
    OR
        SRC Suit {SPADES, HEARTS}
        SRCSTACK Rank descending
$win
PILE ALL RAEBEJ Empty
